  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "3032-root",
    "title": "Dr Charlotte Whiting Becomes Editor-in-Chief of \"Palestine Exploration Quarterly\"",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "AKU-ISMC's Dr Charlotte Whiting has been appointed as Editor-in-Chief of the academic journal ",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "3ce2638511005f15",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "3032-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/3032-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Dr Charlotte Whiting Becomes Editor-in-Chief of \"Palestine Exploration Quarterly\""
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We warmly congratulate AKU-ISMC's Dr Charlotte Whiting on being appointed as Editor-in-Chief of the academic journal "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Palestine Exploration Quarterly",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                },
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://www.pef.org.uk/publications/palestine-exploration-quarterly/",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 4
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "About the Journal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Palestine Exploration Quarterly (PEQ) is the peer-reviewed journal of the Palestine Exploration Fund, which was established in 1865 as the first scholarly society dedicated to the scientific study of what was then generally known as the Holy Land. Despite its historical title, PEQ is concerned not just with Palestine/the Land of Israel, but with the wider region of the Levant - its history, archaeology (including biblical aspects), art, languages, natural and earth ethnology, geography and natural and earth sciences."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 4
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Charlotte Whiting ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://www.aku.edu/ismc/people/Pages/charlotte-whiting.aspx",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Head of Operations, Communications and Development at AKU-ISMC. Charlotte works closely with the Dean to develop strategy and deliver all operational functions at the Institute. She also manages the Institute's marketing and communications and fundraising departments. Charlotte holds a BA Hons from Durham University, an MPhil from Magdalene College Cambridge, and a PhD from the University of Durham, funded by the Arts and Humanities Research Council. Prior to joining AKU, she was Deputy Director of the Iraq Programme at the Council for At-Risk Academics and a Post-Doctoral Research Fellow at the Council for British Research in the Levant (CBRL) in Amman where she directed several research programmes. She is author of Complexity and Diversity in the Late Iron Age Southern Levant: 'Edomite' Archaeology and Scholarly Discourse (Archaeopress, 2007) and Excavations at Tel Jezreel 1995-1996: The Stratigraphy and Neolithic-Iron Age Pottery from Area A (American Schools of Oriental Research, 2021). In addition to being the Editor-in-Chief of the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Palestine Exploration Quarterly, ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "she is also a Trustee of\nthe "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Palestine Exploration Fund.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
